{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26534","headline":"送刘禹锡郎中赴苏州 二 · 姚合","name":"送刘禹锡郎中赴苏州 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"州城全是故吴宫，香径难寻古藓中。\n云水计程千里远，轩车送别九衢空。\n鹤声高下听无尽，潮色朝昏望不同。\n太守吟诗人自理，小斋闲卧白苹风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}